{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025042-skalds-legacy","id":1025042,"title":"Skalds Legacy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-01T03:11:44-08:00","id":1025042,"title":"Skalds Legacy","content":"<b><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Franklin Gothic Medium\">Skalds</span></span></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Franklin Gothic Medium\">Origins</span></span></b><br /> <b>Parent Path or Order:</b> Acanthus, Free Council, Silver Ladder.<br /> <br /> <b>Nickname:</b> Lore-singers<br /> <br /> <b>Background:</b><br /> <br /> <b>Appearance: </b>Varies widely with musical style<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Franklin Gothic Medium\">Doctrine</span></span></b><br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Gnosis 2, Mind 2, Fate 1, Expression 2 and one of the following at 2 or higher Empathy, Occult or Persuasion.<br /> <br /> <b>Initiation:</b><br /> <br /> <b>Organization:</b><br /> <br /> <b>Theory:</b><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Franklin Gothic Medium\">Magic</span></span></b><br /> <b>Ruling Arcanum:</b> Mind<br /> <br /> <b>Yantras:</b><br /> <br /> <b>Oblations:</b><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Franklin Gothic Medium\">Attainments</span></span></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>First Attainment:</b><br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Initiation<br /> <br /> <b>Optional Arcanum:</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Second Attainment:</b><br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Gnosis 2, Mind 2<br /> <br /> <b>Optional Arcanum:</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Third Attainment:</b><br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Gnosis 4, Mind 3<br /> <br /> <b>Optional Arcanum:</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Fourth Attainment:</b><br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Gnosis 6, Mind 4<br /> <br /> <b>Optional Arcanum:</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Fifth Attainment:</b><br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Gnosis 8, Mind 5<br /> <br /> <b>Optional Arcanum:</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 01-01-2017, 07:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-01T04:10:43-08:00","id":1025046,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025042-skalds-legacy#post1025042\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Parent Path or Order:</b> Acanthus, Any Order (rarely if ever The Guardians of the Veil)</div> </div> </div> </div>In Parent Order section, you <i>do not</i> mark Orders that are not taken by Legacy members. You mark those that are <b>fundamental</b> for Legacy. As I mark, with change of paradigms in Legacy writing from 1E to 2E, I would <i>at least</i> add Free Council as Parent Order. I think, contrary to 1E write up, that Silver Ladder would have many Skalds in their previous incarnations, as Law, Music and Magic were much entwined in Scandinavia and Celts culture.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-01T04:16:34-08:00","id":1025047,"title":"","content":"Ok I was just writing stuff as it was in first edition to get a basis of the Legacy to start from, At least that is my mindset for changing/converting something is to know where it started. If i were to choose one Order I would agree that the Free Council would probably be the best one for this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-01T04:31:16-08:00","id":1025050,"title":"","content":"Legacies in 2E can have two Parent Orders - 2E corebook have 11th Question as example. In 1E they were sole Guardians Legacy - in 2E they are both Guardians and Mysterium, split across Orders factions inside.<br /> <br /> Silver Ladder <i>really</i> works for Skalds as Legacy is based on <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skald\" target=\"_blank\">oral singers of Scandinavia</a> and <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bard\" target=\"_blank\">Celts</a> - both groups where 'law sustainers' ( by spreading original culture ) and making sure their people remembered 'magic' of their forefathers. That is Ladders motto of 'Magic is Humanity Birthright', right there. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Citation from Wikipedia on Bards: 'employed by a patron (such as a monarch or noble), to commemorate one or more of the patron's ancestors and to praise the patron's own activities' - it's exactly what more humble Silver Ladder would do with his life, being more voice behind the throne.<br /> <br /> Really, in 1E Skalds Legacy is <i>not </i>having Silver Ladder as Parent Order only on assumptions of writer for <b>Legacies: The Ancient</b> that Tearchs are only power hungry politicians, that is totally not true since their Order book. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Interesting fact - Skalds Legacy can easily be one of main ones magical practices of Indo-European civilization ( on which beliefs <b>Mage </b>is made as game ) so Legacy should have really long story, almost as <i>Thread Cutters</i> from the same book. From Wikipedia:'<span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">In other Indo-European societies, the same function was fulfilled by </span></span></span>skalds<span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">, </span></span></span>rhapsodes<span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">, </span></span></span>minstrels<span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> and </span></span></span><i>scops</i><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">, among others. A hereditary caste of professional poets in </span></span></span>Proto-Indo-European society<span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> has been reconstructed by comparison of the position of poets in medieval Ireland and in ancient India in particular.'</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-01-2017, 07:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-01T04:40:08-08:00","id":1025051,"title":"","content":"Ok I have added the Silver Ladder and we can return to that then other can weigh in. As for an Optional Arcanum I was leaning towards Spirit, they would be invoking spirits from the area as they sing and play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-01T04:57:57-08:00","id":1025054,"title":"","content":"First of, better mark this as Legacy 2E update - I proposed standard topic titles as '[2E Fan] Skalds' format.<br /> <br /> Second - as was not convinced on whole Spirits angle in the 1E write up of group, I would at least mark there are 2 sub Legacies. 'Bards' ( maybe? ) that works with Spirit as Optional and 'Orpheans' works with Death as Optional Arcanum. Would even look if Time could not work as other Optional for them, as it would much more work with Acanthus origins of Legacy and could go with 'recreate past of our people'. So I'm proposing not 1, not even 2, but 3 Optional Arcana for this Legacy! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Limitation would be, obviously, that once learned Attainment with one Optional Arcanum, all the rest need to use this one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-01-2017, 08:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-01T08:28:45-08:00","id":1025075,"title":"","content":"It will not allow me to change the title.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-01T10:09:36-08:00","id":1025098,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025042-skalds-legacy?p=1025075#post1025075\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It will not allow me to change the title.</div> </div> </div> </d